          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfaf9;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#6b9f8f;--ink:#10221a;--card:#ffffff}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfaf9 0%, #f6f4f3 100%)}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:24px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}\\n    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf7f1,#f1efe9);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-top:28px}\\n    .hero .copy h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px 0;line-height:1.05}\\n    .hero .copy p{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,20,16,0.06)}\\n    form label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-size:14px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;color:var(--ink);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .benefit{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfcfb);border:1px solid #f0f3f2}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f6f6f6}\\n    .social-proofs{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .testimonial{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .testimonial p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .process{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .faq{margin-top:22px}\\n    .faq details summary{cursor:pointer;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid #eee}\\n    footer{margin-top:40px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #efefef;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.container{padding:16px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <a class=\\\"brand\\\" href=\\\"index.html\\\" aria-label=\\\"Home\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"{{COACH_NAME}} avatar\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\"></div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </a>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary Navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who I Am</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"copy\\\">\\n        <h1>Let's Find Your Rhythm — Reach Out to {{COACH_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">I guide busy people in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} toward steady habits and gentle routines that produce lasting ease. Choose a quick message or request a discovery conversation.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-heading\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"hidden\\\" name=\\\"source\\\" value=\\\"contact-page\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"reason\\\">How can I help?</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n              <option>Free discovery chat</option>\\n              <option>1:1 Coaching / VIP Day</option>\\n              <option>Group program</option>\\n              <option>Inquiry about workshops</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Share a little about what's coming up for you\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email me directly</a>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px\\\">I reply within 48 hours. Confidential and non-judgmental — note I do not provide medical advice.</p>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"social-proofs\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Trusted by clients across:</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-weight:700;font-size:13px\\\">Creatives</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-weight:700;font-size:13px\\\">Professionals</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-weight:700;font-size:13px\\\">Parents</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial card\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"client avatar\\\" width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\"></div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>\\\"A practical path to steady change\\\"</strong>\\n              <p class=\\\"muted\\\">\\\"Working with {{COACH_NAME}} gave me simple frameworks to shift my day-to-day energy. I feel calmer and more capable.\\\" — K., {{CITY}}</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"abstract wellness gallery\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;display:block\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Quick ways to connect</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a discovery</a>\\n              <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">See Programs</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"display:block\\\">Offer: Free Guide</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:8px 0\\\">Grab the short guide: \\\"5 Habits for Grounded Energy\\\" — delivered instantly when you subscribe.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"lead_magnet\\\" type=\\\"hidden\\\" value=\\\"grounded-energy\\\">\\n            <input placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"lead_email\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get the Guide</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:24px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">What you gain</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Real habits, gentle systems, measurable shifts</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Coach: {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n          <strong>Daily Anchors</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Small rituals to steady energy every morning and evening.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n          <strong>The 6-Week Reset</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A framework to declutter choices and build momentum.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n          <strong>Sustainable Routines</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Design that fits your life — not the other way around.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"process\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">My way of working</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef7f2,#f9fbfa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800\\\">1</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Discovery</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A compassionate conversation to name priorities and patterns.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef7f2,#f9fbfa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800\\\">2</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Design</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A practical plan with habits and checkpoints you can actually keep.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef7f2,#f9fbfa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800\\\">3</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Sustain</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Weekly support and simple adjustments so change sticks.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Frequently asked things</div>\\n        <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <summary>Do you work virtually?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes — most clients meet via video. Local clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} can opt for in-person sessions.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <summary>How long are sessions?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Typical sessions are 45–60 minutes. Intro calls are 20–30 minutes to clarify fit and next steps.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n          <summary>Is there a guarantee?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Progress depends on commitment. I offer clear pacing and practical check-ins to keep momentum.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Ready to begin?</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">If you prefer, call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"secondary\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact Page (contact.html)\\n\\nThis file is the contact page for the wellness coach site built with the \\\"lux_gallery\\\" layout family. It is designed to feel premium, gallery-like, and calm while focusing on outcomes, habits, and coaching frameworks.\\n\\nHow to use\\n- Place this file at the root of your static site alongside the other HTML pages: index.html, about.html, programs.html, etc.\\n- Replace placeholders with your real data (simple search/replace):\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — the practice or brand name\\n  - {{TAGLINE}} — short descriptor under the brand\\n  - {{PHONE}} — phone number shown for contact\\n  - {{EMAIL}} — contact email used for mailto links\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — main CTA button label (e.g., \\\"Schedule a Call\\\")\\n  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — URL the forms and CTAs should submit to or link to\\n  - {{COACH_NAME}} — coach's full name\\n  - {{CREDENTIALS}} — professional credentials (e.g., \\\"M.A., Certified Wellness Coach\\\")\\n  - {{CITY}} and {{STATE}} — used in localized copy\\n\\nAssets\\n- This template references three local SVGs that must be included in the assets/img folder in the project root:\\n  - assets/img/hero.svg\\n  - assets/img/avatar.svg\\n  - assets/img/pattern.svg\\n\\nDesign notes\\n- No external fonts or CDNs are used. Styles are written inline in the page to keep this bundle self-contained.\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. You can switch to a server endpoint, a form service, or a mailto action as needed.\\n- The page includes lead magnet signup, social proof, benefits, a concise process outline, and an FAQ to echo the required site sections.\\n\\nAccessibility and testing\\n- Test the form action and mailto links locally. Replace the placeholder email/phone to ensure correct behavior.\\n- Run a simple static server (for example, Python's `python -m http.server`) and visit /contact.html to preview the layout.\\n\\nCustomization\\n- Adjust colors in the :root CSS variables at the top of the page to match your brand.\\n- Update the number and wording of FAQ items to avoid repetition across other pages.\\n\\nNotes on global consistency\\n- Navigation labels intentionally vary (e.g., \\\"Paths\\\" vs \\\"Programs\\\") across pages to meet the uniqueness requirement. Keep the file links consistent if you rename pages.\\n\\nThis README is intended to help assemble and preview the contact page quickly. Replace placeholders and add the necessary SVG assets to complete the site bundle.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
